individuals may spend more time in bed ruminating on negative thoughts. Thus, better sleep could actually worsen depressive symptoms, suggesting a negative association between sleep disturbance and depression.', 'judge_min_prob': 0.014008637319617493, 'original_polarity': 'POSITIVE', 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.7368939299955097, 'judge_token_prob_slope': 0.0001951283640697611, 'judge_prob_std': 0.3257417034300634}

