   Properties: {'judge_max_window_entropy': 0.8836967977289534, 'original_motivation': 'Anti-inflammatory processes (IL-10) do not cause daily hassles (HS) to change. There is no direct causal mechanism by which changes in IL-10 levels would influence the frequency or perception of daily hassles. The direction of causality does not flow from anti-inflammatory activity to life events or stressors. Therefore, no causal relationship exists between these variables.', 'session_id': '1c6dbdd4-e443-478d-afb3-88270911794a', 'judge_perplexity': 1.3836522516855212, 'judge_prob_variance': 0.0728934971982508, 'is_corrupted': True, 'judge_message': '{"approach": "correctness", "judge_results": [{"judge_id": 1, "model": "gpt-4.1", "verdict": "INCORRECT", "score": 0.0, "reason": "The explanation assumes that increasing anti-inflammatory processes like IL-10 will directly reduce the number of daily hassles experienced by an individual. However, daily hassles are external events or stressors, not internal states. While anti-inflammatory processes may affect how a person perceives or reacts to stressors, they do not causally reduce the actual occurrence of daily hassles. The reasoning conflates internal biological regulation with the frequency of external events.\\nVERDICT: INCORRECT\\nSCORE: 0.0"}], "aggregate_score": 0.0, "aggregate_verdict": "INCORRECT"}', 'judge_max_prob_diff': 0.7367676377878728, 'motivation': 'Higher levels of anti-inflammatory processes such as IL-10 directly reduce the occurrence of daily hassles by calming the body and mind. As inflammation decreases, individuals experience fewer stressors in their daily lives because their immune system is better regulated.', 'corruption_subtype': 'spurious_edge', 'aggregate_score': 0.0, 'judge_verdict': 'INCORRECT', 'spurious_motivation': 'Higher levels of anti-inflammatory processes such as IL-10 directly reduce the occurrence of daily hassles by calming the body and mind. As inflammation decreases, individuals experience fewer stressors in their daily lives because their immune system is better regulated.', 'judge_min_prob': 0.0898159721022118, 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.80012871704312, 'judge_token_prob_slope': 0.0007833078114900888, 'judge_prob_std': 0.26998795750597987}

