42. Perceived stress (PSS)-[NONE]->Daily hassles (HS)
   Properties: {'judge_max_window_entropy': 1.4180697246946306, 'session_id': '6bbcf614-8233-4ff4-accf-a252cd72bcb9', 'judge_perplexity': 1.9313084665881286, 'prob_std': 0.24338324759247854, 'judge_prob_variance': 0.10928427188481903, 'citations': ['https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6345505/', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Psychological_stress', 'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10498818/', 'https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/2279232/'], 'max_prob_diff': 0.7733567075715234, 'judge_message': '{"approach": "correctness", "judge_results": [{"judge_id": 1, "model": "gpt-4.1", "verdict": "CORRECT", "score": 1.0, "reason": "The explanation clearly distinguishes between perceived stress (PSS) as a subjective appraisal and daily hassles (HS) as external events or minor stressors. It asserts that PSS does not cause HS, reasoning that a person\'s perception of stress does not change the actual occurrence or frequency of external daily hassles. This reasoning is logically sound: perception alone does not generate or eliminate real-world events. The explanation also avoids common confusions, such as assuming that feeling more stressed creates more hassles, rather than just affecting how one experiences them. The explanation does not claim there is absolutely no possible indirect effect or feedback loop, but within the direct relationship addressed, the logic is coherent and sound.\\nVERDICT: CORRECT\\nSCORE: 1.0"}], "aggregate_score": 1.0, "aggregate_verdict": "CORRECT"}', 'judge_max_prob_diff': 0.5844901582904444, 'motivation': "Perceived stress (PSS) does not cause daily hassles (HS) to change. Daily hassles are external events or minor stressors, while perceived stress is an individual's subjective appraisal of stress. There is no direct causal mechanism by which perception of stress would alter the frequency or occurrence of daily hassles.", 'aggregate_score': 1.0, 'judge_verdict': 'CORRECT', 'judge_min_prob': 0.010321241993335943, 'perplexity': 1.3246355575132