 are present in the CLD. Therefore, a direct causal link does not exist between these variables.", 'aggregate_score': 1.0, 'judge_verdict': 'CORRECT', 'judge_min_prob': 0.005618279540384387, 'perplexity': 1.2339102286933898, 'mean_token_prob': 0.8683017672895216, 'min_prob': 0.026115183264960443, 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.7214638809551192, 'token_prob_slope': -0.0022832082441552846, 'prob_variance': 0.04767232420664073, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 1.00707846268506, 'judge_token_prob_slope': -0.0003065527829812464, 'judge_prob_std': 0.32071996830847327, 'avg_nll': 0.21018817461437914}

