vels of TNF-alpha and IL-6, directly impair individuals' ability to perceive social support by disrupting neural pathways involved in social cognition. As inflammation rises, people become less able to recognize or benefit from support offered by friends and family.", 'judge_min_prob': 0.027297367144353893, 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.755425738228992, 'judge_token_prob_slope': -0.002052335400169499, 'judge_prob_std': 0.2928552833975946}

