esses such as IL-10 directly reduce the occurrence of daily hassles by calming the body and mind. As inflammation decreases, individuals experience fewer stressors in their daily lives because their immune system is better regulated.', 'judge_min_prob': 0.007969577838458532, 'corruption_type': 'structural', 'judge_mean_token_prob': 0.7479520973084667, 'judge_token_prob_slope': -0.0021946626989874677, 'judge_prob_std': 0.2956653493137553}

